[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14402.63, "timestamp": "04:00:02", "text": "是的，我正在攒钱买VR设备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14406.469, "timestamp": "04:00:06", "text": "此外，VPN 的主要用途是观看更多流媒体内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14411.07, "timestamp": "04:00:11", "text": "真是个恶霸。是的，确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14414.83, "timestamp": "04:00:14", "text": "疼痛。下一期节目将在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14417.269, "timestamp": "04:00:17", "text": "周六。我还在计划要做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14419.99, "timestamp": "04:00:19", "text": "周六执行。这可能是一次合作，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14425.79, "timestamp": "04:00:25", "text": "视情况而定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14428.429, "timestamp": "04:00:28", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14433.269, "timestamp": "04:00:33", "text": "嗯，这要看情况。嗯，是的，将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14435.75, "timestamp": "04:00:35", "text": "可能是合作，也可能不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14438.75, "timestamp": "04:00:38", "text": "能否拿到手取决于时机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14441.309, "timestamp": "04:00:41", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14448.389, "timestamp": "04:00:48", "text": "就这么定了，然后呢？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14450.95, "timestamp": "04:00:50", "text": "别的？我没有为此制定计划。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14452.59, "timestamp": "04:00:52", "text": "星期。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14455.91, "timestamp": "04:00:55", "text": "对不起。呃，我至少应该更新一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14457.83, "timestamp": "04:00:57", "text": "我在谷歌日历中记录着"}]